Recommends: cosign
Conflicts:
Replaces:
Provides: privacytk
Description: corporate LLM-agent output filter
 privacytk is a corporate fork of rtk-ai/rtk v0.49.0 tuned for environments
 where the CLI cannot, by policy, exfiltrate code, secrets, or usage data.
 .
 Features:
  - 100% of the upstream token-compression filters (git, cargo, cargo
    test, pytest, go test, docker ps, kubectl, etc.).
  - No telemetry: ureq removed, telemetry POST site compiled out.
  - Default-deny network: every outbound URL must pass an explicit
    allowlist at /etc/skel/.config/privacytk/network.toml.
  - Local secrets/PII scanner (privacytk audit) with redacted previews.
  - CFD integration: cfd-context auto-injects on Claude Code SessionStart.
  - Ephemeral mode: PRIVACYTK_EPHEMERAL=1 routes SQLite to :memory:.
 .
 Provenance: the .deb ships with an SBOM (SPDX 2.3 + CycloneDX 1.5) and
 a cosign signature. Verify before installing.
Homepage: https://internal.example.com/privacytk
